  "title": "Portfolio",
  "text": "Nick Kozyrev\n\nworks\n\nabout\n\nget in touch\n\nabout\n\ntools\n\ncontact\n\nI create motion for brands, studios, and digital products\n\nabout\n\nI’m a motion and visual designer focused on 2D, faux 3D, lightweight 3D, and UI motion. I create showreels, advertising, product content, and branded motion, taking projects from concept to final animation.\n\nI also work on selected branding and logo projects, extending visual identities across static and digital formats.\n\nTools\n\nAfter Effects\n\nRive\n\nBlender\n\nPhotoshop\n\nIllustrator\n\nFigma\n\ncontact\n\nAvailable for freelance projects and collaborations.\n\ntelegram\n\n@desire2223\n\nBehance\n\nwww.behance.net\n\n2026 Nick Kozyrev.\n\ntelegram\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.",
